{"$schema":"https://json-schema.org/draft/2020-12/schema","$id":"slice.schema.json","title":"Slice（切片）","description":"W2 的審查單位。slice_id＝sha256(JCS({files, redaction_map_sha256, prompt_template_sha256}))（E6）：檔案範圍、遮罩對照與 prompt 範本都相同時，不同 run 得到同一 ID（可沿用）。excluded_models 記錄因 context 或資料等級而不能收到此切片的模型。","type":"object","additionalProperties":false,
"properties":{
"slice_id":{"$ref":"common.schema.json#/$defs/sha256"},
"run_id":{"$ref":"common.schema.json#/$defs/run_id"},
"files":{"type":"array","items":{"type":"object","additionalProperties":false,"properties":{"path":{"type":"string"},"sha256":{"$ref":"common.schema.json#/$defs/sha256"},"line_start":{"type":"integer","minimum":1},"line_end":{"type":"integer","minimum":1}},"required":["path","sha256","line_start","line_end"]},"minItems":1},
"entry_points":{"type":"array","items":{"type":"string"},"description":"切片涵蓋的端點或函式（例如 GET /api/invoices/{id}）"},
"facets":{"type":"array","items":{"enum":["authz","authn_session","injection","data_access","secrets_config","business_logic","llm_integration","file_handling","ssrf_outbound","frontend_client","webhooks_integrations","crypto","cicd_iac"]},"minItems":1},
"redaction_map_sha256":{"$ref":"common.schema.json#/$defs/sha256","description":"套用的 redaction map 的 content hash（＝run.redaction_map_ref；E-SLICE-IDENTITY）"},
"prompt_template_sha256":{"$ref":"common.schema.json#/$defs/sha256","description":"審查 prompt 範本的 hash（run.prompt_templates 之一；E-SLICE-IDENTITY）"},
"token_count":{"type":"integer","minimum":0},
"tokenizer":{"type":"string","description":"計算 token_count 的 tokenizer（估計值；各廠商不同）"},
"redacted":{"const":true,"description":"已套用 redaction map"},
"excluded_models":{"type":"array","items":{"type":"object","additionalProperties":false,"properties":{"model_key":{"type":"string"},"reason":{"enum":["context_exceeded","data_class","policy"]}},"required":["model_key","reason"]}}},
"required":["slice_id","run_id","files","redaction_map_sha256","prompt_template_sha256","entry_points","facets","token_count","tokenizer","redacted","excluded_models"]}
